From 175ecf946b41ebb37a678a803ae90883b8ab74b7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 06:46:45 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] selftests: mediatek: exercise ordered display runtime PM

Exercise production supplier snapshots and teardown ownership with shared consumers, pending PM operations, acquisition and release failures, and retained resources. Verify resume admission after a logically on domain is quarantined.

Signed-off-by: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
---
